    "comparator_note": "4-mer counts + ridge, recomputed IN-RUN on identical splits/seeds. The census's 0.1313 is context, NOT the comparator: a cited number from a different split cannot be paired.",
    "primary_metric": "spearman on the held-out genomic blocks",
    "margin": 0.02,
    "margin_note": "INHERITED from the tile-rung arms so the bars stay commensurable, and the inheritance is disclosed because it is NOT scale-free: 0.02 against this rung's incumbent (~0.13) is a ~15% relative gain, whereas against the tile rung's ~0.40 it is ~5%. The verdict keys on the ABSOLUTE 0.02; the relative figure is reported beside it so no reader is misled.",
    "min_seeds_winning": 8,
    "n_seeds": 10,
    "widths": [
      3,
